  "details": "Sending a Custom Event both local and networked to a seperate GameObject after someone joins the lobby does not work. Objects sending events to themselves work fine.\nhttps://streamable.com/1dy0t\nIn the video \"Spawning (Spawner)\" is printed from a custom event in an UdonBehavior that is from a different GameObject. \"Message (Call From Button)\" are events that are from the button itself).\nVRCSDK3-2020.3.21.12.04\nUDONSDK-2020.3.21.12.24\n\nUpdate: This was because I was changing the playermods for the joining player onPlayerJoin which seemed to mess with events for that object",
